correction('P001362','example matrix A','A=[[0,1],[1,0]] while A^2=-1','A=[[0,1],[-1,0]] is a consistent correction, retaining I=diag(1,-1).','Direct scan confirms two positive ones. Two independent exact calculations are preserved in check_spectral_operators.py and its output.')
